<div class="text-center my-5">
  <i aria-hidden="true" class="bi bi-truck" style="font-size: 20vh;"></i>
  {{#if user}}
    <h1 class="h2">Welcome, {{user.name}}</h1>
    {{#if isContractor}}
      <p>Use <strong>My deliveries</strong> in the menu to create and manage your delivery records,
         and <strong>Complete and rate</strong> to close the inspected deliveries.</p>
    {{else if isInspector}}
      <p>Use <strong>Inspections</strong> in the menu to inspect the deliveries that have arrived on site.</p>
    {{else if isSupplier}}
      <p>Use <strong>Assigned deliveries</strong> in the menu to update the status of your deliveries,
         <strong>Quality documents</strong> to add the delivery notes and test reports,
         and <strong>My rating and history</strong> to see how the contractors rated you.</p>
    {{else if isCompany}}
      <p>Use <strong>Users of my company</strong> in the menu to see the people who registered for {{user.orgName}} and to switch an account off or on.
         {{#if isContractorCompany}}Use <strong>Inspection companies</strong> to appoint a third-party inspection company for your projects.{{/if}}
         {{#if isInspectionCompany}}<strong>Contractors that appointed us</strong> shows whose deliveries your inspectors can inspect.{{/if}}</p>
    {{else if isAdmin}}
      <p>Use <strong>Companies</strong> in the menu to check and approve the companies that registered,
         and <strong>All users</strong> to see who works for which company.</p>
    {{else}}
      <p>The pages for your role are not ready yet.</p>
    {{/if}}
  {{else}}
    <h1 class="h2">Material Delivery Closed-Loop</h1>
    <p>Please <a href="/login" hx-boost="true" hx-target="#main">sign in</a> to continue, or <a href="/register" hx-boost="true" hx-target="#main">register</a> if you are new.</p>
  {{/if}}
</div>
